er library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/alert(isPresented:error:actions:message:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/alert(isPresented:error:actions:message:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"alert"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text